113
00:09:03,431 --> 00:09:08,214
[SPEAKER_05]: vantage point that you come from in so far as being one of our residents.

114
00:09:09,275 --> 00:09:10,495
[SPEAKER_05]: I wish you would have brought that to me.

115
00:09:11,956 --> 00:09:12,957
[SPEAKER_05]: You could have brought that to me.

116
00:09:13,757 --> 00:09:21,622
