117
00:09:22,123 --> 00:09:27,526
[SPEAKER_05]: The only inquiry I've received was from a city councilor who was contacted and who contacted me.

118
00:09:28,727 --> 00:09:37,735
[SPEAKER_05]: And the response that I provided to that city councilor was a response that I received from maintenance who had requested that those storage areas be removed.

119
00:09:38,156 --> 00:09:42,960
[SPEAKER_05]: They described them to me as three foot by three foot by four foot deep.

120
00:09:43,941 --> 00:09:46,223
[SPEAKER_05]: We had a similar issue when we were

121
