[SPEAKER_05]: dealing with the storage areas at Walkland Court.

122
00:09:50,950 --> 00:09:57,591
[SPEAKER_05]: And I'm sure, Losa, you'll remember that because you were on the board at that point in time when we had to remove those storage facilities also.

123
