[SPEAKER_05]: If she's not satisfied with Jennifer, then she can come to me.

156
00:12:27,786 --> 00:12:30,647
[SPEAKER_05]: If she's not satisfied with me, then she can come to the board.

157
00:12:32,124 --> 00:12:37,406
[SPEAKER_05]: My point being is we would have been able to resolve this back on July 9th, I believe.

158
