[SPEAKER_08]: If there's availability of them.

182
00:14:33,282 --> 00:14:33,602
[SPEAKER_08]: Okay.

183
00:14:33,622 --> 00:14:34,303
[SPEAKER_08]: Does that satisfy you?

184
00:14:49,333 --> 00:14:53,137
[SPEAKER_08]: Yeah, I think that's along the lines of what I was hoping.

185
00:14:54,277 --> 00:14:57,440
[SPEAKER_08]: I mean, I don't use an air conditioner, but I know a lot of people do.

186
00:14:57,460 --> 00:15:02,585
[SPEAKER_08]: I think that her arguments are particularly salient rather than having a big air conditioner on the floor or something like this.

187
00:15:03,165 --> 00:15:09,531
